Video bank (galton_hoard/videobench)

* galton_hoard/videobench/data/prompts.json holds 139 briefs taken from
  awesome-opus5-5-videos (MIT, copyright yihui-dev; the list of 2026-10-12),
  filtered to the ones whose prompt is not partial and has more than 400
  characters. Each brief keeps its author, the link to the author and the link to
  the original post. The videos and the prompts belong to their authors; the MIT
  licence of the list covers the list. The licence text is in
  LICENSE.awesome-opus5-5-videos.
* The jury rubric (the seven dimensions and the 1-10 scale, of which the bank
  scores six because the pages are silent) follows the review prompt of mg-styles-15
  (MIT, copyright Vincentwei1021). The licence text is in LICENSE.mg-styles-15.

The contract that makes an animation measurable (a self-contained page with
window.seek(t)), the renderer, the automatic checks and the contact sheet were
written for this project.
